    {
      "id": "access_and_operatable",
      "representation": "eActor::IsOperatable (0x8067E0) tests non-empty placer human slots (+0x10 != +0x18). eActor::CanAccess (0x80F710) checks abandoned tag, operatable bit 8, player ownership +0xDA8, any_crew/ally_crew dynamic indices, and ally relation 0xA65410.",
